                                                                                        'of the last stacking '
                                                                                        'level will be fit with '
                                                                                        'all (successful) models '
                                                                                        'from all previous '
                                                                                        'layers as base models.\n'
                                                                                        'If stacking is '
                                                                                        'disabled, settings this '
                                                                                        'to True or False makes '
                                                                                        'no difference because '
                                                                                        'the '
                                                                                        'WeightedEnsembleModel '
                                                                                        'L2 always uses all '
                                                                                        'models from L1.\n'
                                                                                        'It is recommended to '
                                                                                        'keep this value set to '
                                                                                        'True to maximize '
                                                                                        'predictive quality.',
