                                                                             'After that, if '
                                                                             'calc_cv_statistics=true, '
                                                                             'statistics on metrics are '
                                                                             'calculated\n'
                                                                             'using cross-validation using best '
                                                                             'parameters and the model is fitted '
                                                                             'with these parameters.\n'
                                                                             '\n'
                                                                             'If False, every iteration of grid '
                                                                             'search evaluates results on '
                                                                             'cross-validation.\n'
                                                                             'It is recommended to set parameter '
