                                                                    'desired ratio of the number of\n'
                                                                    '  samples in the minority class over the '
                                                                    'number of samples in the\n'
                                                                    '  majority class after resampling. '
                                                                    'Therefore, the ratio is expressed as\n'
                                                                    '  :math:`\\alpha_{os} = N_{rm} / N_{M}` '
