                                                                    '  number of samples in the minority class '
                                                                    'after resampling and\n'
                                                                    '  :math:`N_{M}` is the number of samples in '
                                                                    'the majority class.\n'
                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    '    .. warning::\n'
                                                                    '       ``float`` is only available for '
                                                                    '**binary** classification. An\n'
                                                                    '       error is raised for multi-class '
                                                                    'classification.\n'
                                                                    '\n'
