                                                                    'by the resampling. The\n'
                                                                    '  number of samples in the different '
                                                                    'classes will be equalized.\n'
                                                                    '  Possible choices are:\n'
                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    "    ``'minority'``: resample only the "
                                                                    'minority class;\n'
                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    "    ``'not minority'``: resample all "
