                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    '- When ``str``, specify the class targeted '
                                                                    'by the resampling. Note the\n'
                                                                    '  the number of samples will not be equal '
                                                                    'in each. Possible choices\n'
                                                                    '  are:\n'
                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    "    ``'majority'``: resample only the "
                                                                    'majority class;\n'
                                                                    '\n'
                                                                    "    ``'not minority'``: resample all "
