                                                              '    for sharing memory with worker processes. If '
                                                              'None, this will try in\n'
                                                              '    order:\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              '    - a folder pointed by the '
                                                              '``JOBLIB_TEMP_FOLDER`` environment\n'
