                                                              'operating systems.\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              'max_nbytes int, str, or None, optional, '
                                                              "default='1M'\n"
                                                              '    Threshold on the size of arrays passed to the '
                                                              'workers that\n'
                                                              '    triggers automated memory mapping in '
                                                              'temp_folder. Can be an int\n'
                                                              '    in Bytes, or a human-readable string, e.g., '
                                                              "'1M' for 1 megabyte.\n"
                                                              '    Use None to disable memmapping of large '
                                                              'arrays.',
