                                                  'If the ``cls`` argument is not provided, two things will '
                                                  'happen\n'
                                                  'in accordance with the specification. First, if the schema '
                                                  'has a\n'
                                                  ':kw:`$schema` keyword containing a known meta-schema [#]_ '
                                                  'then the\n'
                                                  'proper validator will be used. The specification recommends '
                                                  'that\n'
                                                  'all schemas contain :kw:`$schema` properties for this reason. '
                                                  'If no\n'
                                                  ':kw:`$schema` property is found, the default validator class '
                                                  'is the\n'
                                                  'latest released draft.\n'
                                                  '\n'
