                'This method is called only for the parameters not contained in the search space returned\n'
                'by :func:`~optuna.samplers.BaseSampler.sample_relative` method. This method is suitable\n'
                'for sampling algorithms that do not use relationship between parameters such as random\n'
                'sampling and TPE.\n'
