                                                             "when the result's index (and column) labels match "
                                                             'the inputs, and\n'
                                                             'are included otherwise.\n'
                                                             '\n'
                                                             '.. versionchanged:: 1.5.0\n'
                                                             '\n'
                                                             '   Warns that ``group_keys`` will no longer be '
                                                             'ignored when the\n'
                                                             '   result from ``apply`` is a like-indexed Series '
