                                                         '\n'
                                                         '  - allowed orients are '
                                                         "``{'split','records','index'}``\n"
                                                         "  - default is ``'index'``\n"
                                                         '  - The Series index must be unique for orient '
                                                         "``'index'``.\n"
                                                         '\n'
                                                         "* when ``typ == 'frame'``,\n"
                                                         '\n'
                                                         "  - allowed orients are ``{'split','records','index',\n"
                                                         "    'columns','values', 'table'}``\n"
                                                         "  - default is ``'columns'``\n"
                                                         '  - The DataFrame index must be unique for orients '
