                                                              'device\n'
                                                              '    Specify the jax `Device` on which the array '
                                                              'will be created; can provide\n'
                                                              '    a string (such as "cpu", "gpu", or "tpu") in '
                                                              'which case the device is\n'
                                                              '    retrieved as `jax.devices(string)[0]`. For '
                                                              'more specific control you\n'
                                                              '    can supply the instantiated `Device` '
                                                              'directly. If None, arrays are\n'
                                                              '    created on the default device.\n'
                                                              'label\n'
                                                              '    One or more column names, expressions, or '
                                                              'selectors that label the feature\n'
                                                              '    data; results in a `{"label": ..., '
                                                              '"features": ...}` dict being returned\n'
                                                              '    when `return_type` is "dict" instead of a '
                                                              '`{"col": array, }` dict.\n'
                                                              'features\n'
                                                              '    One or more column names, expressions, or '
                                                              'selectors that contain the feature\n'
                                                              '    data; if omitted, all columns that are not '
                                                              'designated as part of the label\n'
                                                              '    are used. Only applies when `return_type` is '
                                                              '"dict".\n'
                                                              'dtype\n'
                                                              '    Unify the dtype of all returned arrays; this '
                                                              'casts any column that is\n'
                                                              '    not already of the required dtype before '
                                                              'converting to Array. Note that\n'
                                                              '    export will be single-precision (32bit) '
