                                                         'slice_pushdown\n'
                                                         '    Slice pushdown optimization.\n'
                                                         'comm_subplan_elim\n'
                                                         '    Will try to cache branching subplans that occur on '
                                                         'self-joins or unions.\n'
                                                         'comm_subexpr_elim\n'
