                                                              'compression means smaller files on\n'
                                                              '    disk.\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              '    - "gzip" : min-level: 0, max-level: 10.\n'
                                                              '    - "brotli" : min-level: 0, max-level: 11.\n'
                                                              '    - "zstd" : min-level: 1, max-level: 22.\n'
                                                              'statistics\n'
                                                              '    Write statistics to the parquet headers. This '
                                                              'is the default behavior.\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              '    Possible values:\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              '    - `True`: enable default set of statistics '
                                                              '(default). Some\n'
                                                              '      statistics may be disabled.\n'
                                                              '    - `False`: disable all statistics\n'
                                                              '    - "full": calculate and write all available '
                                                              'statistics. Cannot be\n'
