                '\n'
                'Type adapters provide a flexible way to perform validation and serialization based on a Python '
                'type.\n'
                '\n'
                'A `TypeAdapter` instance exposes some of the functionality from `BaseModel` instance methods\n'
                'for types that do not have such methods (such as dataclasses, primitive types, and more).\n'
                '\n'
