                                                     'have the\n'
                                                     'shape (m,) or be a scalar, in the latter case a bound will '
                                                     'be the same\n'
                                                     'for all components of the constraint. Use ``np.inf`` with '
                                                     'an\n'
                                                     'appropriate sign to specify a one-sided constraint.\n'
                                                     'Set components of `lb` and `ub` equal to represent an '
                                                     'equality\n'
                                                     'constraint. Note that you can mix constraints of different '
                                                     'types:\n'
                                                     'interval, one-sided or equality, by setting different '
                                                     'components of\n'
                                                     '`lb` and `ub` as  necessary. Defaults to ``lb = -np.inf``\n'
