                                                          '        prior notice.\n'
                                                          '\n'
                                                          '    Default: None.\n'
                                                          '    For problems with sparse input, this option is '
                                                          'ignored, and the\n'
                                                          '    pivot-based algorithm presented in [5]_ is used.\n'
