                                                      '    Value of the objective function.\n'
                                                      'success : bool\n'
                                                      '    True if the algorithm succeeded in finding an optimal '
                                                      'solution.\n'
                                                      'slack : 1-D array\n'
                                                      '    The values of the slack variables. Each slack '
                                                      'variable corresponds\n'
                                                      '    to an inequality constraint. If the slack is zero, '
                                                      'then the\n'
                                                      '    corresponding constraint is active.\n'
                                                      'con : 1-D array\n'
