                                                          'global routine are also passed to the '
                                                          'scipy.optimize.minimize routine.\n'
                                                          'The options that are also passed to the local routine '
                                                          'are marked with\n'
                                                          '"(L)".\n'
                                                          '\n'
                                                          'Stopping criteria, the algorithm will terminate if '
                                                          'any of the specified\n'
                                                          'criteria are met. However, the default algorithm does '
                                                          'not require any\n'
