                '\n'
                'eval_jacobi(n, alpha, beta, x, out=None)\n'
                '\n'
                'Evaluate Jacobi polynomial at a point.\n'
                '\n'
                'The Jacobi polynomials can be defined via the Gauss hypergeometric\n'
