                                                       '\n'
                                                       '- optimizer : The optimizer to use.  The optimizer must '
                                                       'take\n'
                                                       '  ``func`` and starting position as the first two '
                                                       'arguments,\n'
                                                       '  plus ``args`` (for extra arguments to pass to the\n'
                                                       '  function to be optimized) and ``disp=0`` to suppress\n'
