                '    Parameter estimates for generic data.\n'
                '    See `scipy.stats.rv_continuous.fit '
                '<https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.rv_continuous.fit.html#scipy.stats.rv_continuous.fit>`__ '
