                'logsf(x, c, loc=0, scale=1)\n'
                '    Log of the survival function.\n'
                'ppf(q, c, loc=0, scale=1)\n'
                '    Percent point function (inverse of ``cdf`` --- percentiles).\n'
                'isf(q, c, loc=0, scale=1)\n'
