                '\n'
                'These parameters correspond to label size, line thickness, etc. For more\n'
                'information, see the :doc:`aesthetics tutorial <../tutorial/aesthetics>`.\n'
                '\n'
                'The base context is "notebook", and the other contexts are "paper", "talk",\n'
