                                                     'used. In all\n'
                                                     'other cases, :class:`KFold` is used. These splitters are '
                                                     'instantiated\n'
                                                     'with `shuffle=False` so the splits will be the same across '
                                                     'calls.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Refer :ref:`User Guide <cross_validation>` for the '
