                                                               '      spawning of the jobs\n'
                                                               '\n'
                                                               '    - An int, giving the exact number of total '
                                                               'jobs that are\n'
                                                               '      spawned\n'
                                                               '\n'
                                                               '    - A str, giving an expression as a function '
                                                               'of n_jobs,\n'
