                                                            '`"ball_tree"` algorithms use the\n'
                                                            ':class:`~sklearn.neighbors.NearestNeighbors` '
                                                            'estimator.\n'
                                                            '\n'
                                                            'If the `X` passed during `fit` is sparse or '
                                                            '`metric` is invalid for\n'
                                                            'both :class:`~sklearn.neighbors.KDTree` and\n'
                                                            ':class:`~sklearn.neighbors.BallTree`, then it '
