                                                       "an empirical probability distribution of the points' "
                                                       'contribution to the\n'
                                                       'overall inertia. This technique speeds up convergence. '
                                                       'The algorithm\n'
                                                       'implemented is "greedy k-means++". It differs from the '
                                                       'vanilla k-means++\n'
                                                       'by making several trials at each sampling step and '
