                                                         'In contrast to KMeans, the algorithm is only run once, '
                                                         'using the best of\n'
                                                         'the `n_init` initializations as measured by inertia. '
                                                         'Several runs are\n'
                                                         'recommended for sparse high-dimensional problems (see\n'
