                                                          '    - "average" uses the average of the distances of '
                                                          'each observation of\n'
                                                          '      the two sets.\n'
                                                          '    - "complete" or maximum linkage uses the maximum '
                                                          'distances between\n'
                                                          '      all observations of the two sets.\n'
                                                          '    - "single" uses the minimum of the distances '
                                                          'between all\n'
                                                          '      observations of the two sets.',
