                                                               'boosting iteration.\n'
                                                               'In addition, it controls the random permutation '
                                                               'of the features at\n'
                                                               'each split (see Notes for more details).\n'
                                                               'It also controls the random splitting of the '
                                                               'training data to obtain a\n'
                                                               'validation set if `n_iter_no_change` is not '
