                                                       "For multiclass classification problems, 'log_loss' is "
                                                       'also known as multinomial\n'
                                                       'deviance or categorical crossentropy. Internally, the '
                                                       'model fits one tree per\n'
                                                       'boosting iteration and per class and uses the softmax '
                                                       'function as inverse link\n'
                                                       'function to compute the predicted probabilities of the '
