                                                               'If not given, all classes are supposed to have '
                                                               'weight one.\n'
                                                               '\n'
                                                               'The "balanced" mode uses the values of y to '
                                                               'automatically adjust\n'
                                                               'weights inversely proportional to class '
                                                               'frequencies in the input data\n'
                                                               'as ``n_samples / (n_classes * '
                                                               'np.bincount(y))``.\n'
                                                               '\n'
                                                               'Note that these weights will be multiplied with '
