                                                              '.. deprecated:: 1.5\n'
                                                              '   ``multi_class`` was deprecated in version 1.5 '
                                                              'and will be removed in 1.7.\n'
                                                              "   From then on, the recommended 'multinomial' "
                                                              'will always be used for\n'
                                                              '   `n_classes >= 3`.\n'
                                                              "   Solvers that do not support 'multinomial' will "
                                                              'raise an error.\n'
                                                              '   Use '
