                                                            '(i.e. output of `predict_proba`) or decision scores '
                                                            '(i.e. output of\n'
                                                            '`decision_function`) into a class label. When '
                                                            '`"auto"`, the threshold is set\n'
                                                            'to 0.5 if `predict_proba` is used as '
                                                            '`response_method`, otherwise it is set to\n'
                                                            '0 (i.e. the default threshold for '
