                                                                  'threshold. It can be:\n'
                                                                  '\n'
                                                                  '* if `"auto"`, it will try to invoke, for '
                                                                  'each classifier,\n'
                                                                  '  `"predict_proba"` or `"decision_function"` '
                                                                  'in that order.\n'
                                                                  '* otherwise, one of `"predict_proba"` or '
                                                                  '`"decision_function"`.\n'
