                                                         'irls\n'
                                                         'optimization. Default is `lstsq` which uses the same '
                                                         'underlying\n'
                                                         "svd based approach as 'pinv', but is faster during "
                                                         'iterations.\n'
                                                         "'lstsq' and 'pinv' regularize the estimate in singular "
                                                         'and\n'
                                                         'near-singular cases by truncating small singular '
                                                         'values based\n'
                                                         'on `rcond` of the respective numpy.linalg function. '
