                                                             'and the same\n'
                                                             '    number of columns as transform_M\n'
                                                             '\n'
                                                             'If `hypotheses` is None: 1) the effect of each '
                                                             'independent variable\n'
                                                             'on the dependent variables will be tested. Or 2) '
                                                             'if model is created\n'
                                                             'using a formula,  `hypotheses` will be created '
                                                             'according to\n'
                                                             '`design_info`. 1) and 2) is equivalent if no '
                                                             'additional variables\n'
                                                             'are created by the formula (e.g. dummy variables '
                                                             'for categorical\n'
                                                             'variables and interaction terms)\n'
                                                             '\n'
                                                             '    skip_intercept_test : bool\n'
                                                             '        If true, then testing the intercept is '
                                                             'skipped, the model is not\n'
                                                             '        changed.\n'
                                                             '        Note: If a term has a numerically '
                                                             'insignificant effect, then\n'
