                                                        "- 'var' : returns the estimated variance of endog "
                                                        'implied by the\n'
                                                        '  model.\n'
                                                        "- 'prob-trunc' : probability of truncation. This is the "
                                                        'probability\n'
                                                        '  of observing a zero count implied\n'
                                                        '  by the truncation model.\n'
                                                        "- 'prob' : probabilities of each count from 0 to "
