                                                           'that assumes\n'
                                                           '  homoskedasticity.\n'
                                                           "* 'HC0', 'HC1', 'HC2', 'HC3' - Variants of White's\n"
                                                           '  (or Eiker-Huber-White) covariance estimator. `HC0` '
                                                           'is the\n'
                                                           '  standard implementation.  The other make '
                                                           'corrections to improve\n'
                                                           '  the finite sample performance of the '
                                                           'heteroskedasticity robust\n'
                                                           '  covariance estimator.\n'
                                                           "* 'HAC' - Heteroskedasticity-autocorrelation robust "
                                                           'covariance\n'
                                                           '  estimation. Supports cov_kwds.\n'
                                                           '\n'
                                                           '  - `maxlags` integer (required) : number of lags to '
                                                           'use.\n'
                                                           '  - `kernel` callable or str (optional) : kernel\n'
                                                           "      currently available kernels are ['bartlett', "
                                                           "'uniform'],\n"
                                                           '      default is Bartlett.\n'
                                                           '  - `use_correction` bool (optional) : If true, use '
