                                                        ':math:`(C, H_{out}, W_{out})`, where\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        '  .. math::\n'
                                                        '      H_{out} = \\left\\lfloor\\frac{H_{in}  + 2 '
                                                        '\\times \\text{padding}[0] -\n'
                                                        '        \\text{kernel\\_size}[0]}{\\text{stride}[0]} + '
                                                        '1\\right\\rfloor\n'
