                                                        '  .. math::\n'
                                                        '      W_{out} = \\left\\lfloor\\frac{W_{in}  + 2 '
                                                        '\\times \\text{padding}[1] -\n'
                                                        '        \\text{kernel\\_size}[1]}{\\text{stride}[1]} + '
                                                        '1\\right\\rfloor\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        '  Per the note above, if ``ceil_mode`` is True and '
                                                        ':math:`(H_{out} - 1)\\times \\text{stride}[0]\\geq '
                                                        'H_{in}\n'
                                                        '  + \\text{padding}[0]`, we skip the last window as it '
