                                                          '* **h_n**: tensor of shape :math:`(D * '
                                                          '\\text{num\\_layers}, H_{out})` for unbatched input '
                                                          'or\n'
                                                          '  :math:`(D * \\text{num\\_layers}, N, H_{out})` '
                                                          'containing the\n'
                                                          '  final hidden state for each element in the '
                                                          'sequence. When ``bidirectional=True``,\n'
                                                          '  `h_n` will contain a concatenation of the final '
                                                          'forward and reverse hidden states, respectively.\n'
                                                          '* **c_n**: tensor of shape :math:`(D * '
                                                          '\\text{num\\_layers}, H_{cell})` for unbatched input '
                                                          'or\n'
                                                          '  :math:`(D * \\text{num\\_layers}, N, H_{cell})` '
                                                          'containing the\n'
                                                          '  final cell state for each element in the sequence. '
                                                          'When ``bidirectional=True``,\n'
                                                          '  `c_n` will contain a concatenation of the final '
                                                          'forward and reverse cell states, respectively.',
