                                                              'For advanced usage on Early stopping like '
                                                              'directly choosing to maximize instead\n'
                                                              'of minimize, see '
                                                              ':py:obj:`xgboost.callback.EarlyStopping`.\n'
                                                              '\n'
                                                              'See :doc:`/tutorials/custom_metric_obj` and '
